  "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Gasr Banat.\u00a0 This name is a form of Qa\u015fr al-Ban\u0101t or \"maiden castle\" a term that has been applied to Roman-period sites in North Africa and the Near East.</p>",
